Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for sending your financial guarantee form. However, you must also send us a proof of funds for $45,533 in the form of a bank statement. Please email this document to fg@asu.edu.

If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
